#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Build the installer image, or check what a build would rest on.

iso/build --check-profile [--root DIR]
    Static validation of iso/ (ADR 0001, acceptance 1). Normal user, offline.
iso/build --check-admission --mode MODE --manifest TSV [--admission FILE]
    Compare a package manifest with iso/admission.yml. A release candidate
    refuses any row without an admitted entry at its exact version.
iso/build --check-signature-policy --work DIR
    Root inside a disposable builder only: prove with the real pacman and a
    throwaway key that the profile's SigLevel installs a signed package from
    an unsigned database and refuses an unsigned or foreign-key package.
iso/build --output DIR --work DIR --verify-user USER
    Root inside a disposable builder only: build the image from the clean
    commit C, in the mode of iso/build-inputs.yml, and write its records.
"""

